			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2048890">
									

<p>I like the mangled speech, but I'm going to add my voice to the people saying that the &quot;we hunger&quot; line is silly and really weakens the piece. It doesn't make sense in-universe either; I doubt this thing would have a notion of &quot;hunger&quot; as something distinct from laughter.</p>
<p>I'm also not really seeing much of a connection to the puppy killer. I mean, I guess they're both designed to be funny in a horrible kind of way, but the puppy killer is very human in its sensibility. This&#8230; isn't.</p>
<p>Also, I fixed a minor typo in the Thatcher section.</p>

