<p>So I really, really like this one. It was toeing the line of &quot;random for randomness sake&quot; throughout, but when I finished I realized I had thoroughly enjoyed the whole experience. The last box really does a good job of drawing it all together, even if the end of it breaks character slightly. This is the kind of article that does horror comedy without doing comedy horror; you laugh because it's funny, but it doesn't feel like you should be laughing. All in all, it leaves you feeling uneasy and uncomfortable, which was no doubt the objective.</p>
<p>An easy +1 for me.</p>

